t","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/530075/5300750314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/530075/5300750313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_SELAN_2011_2012_18102012054444.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Management stated that the company signed Revenue Sharing Contracts with the Government of India for two large contract areas in KG Onshore and the Cambay Basin. The company expects to exit the current fiscal year with a production rate of around 2,500 barrels of oil equivalent per day and aims to reach 5,000 barrels by FY29. Operating margins remained strong with EBITDA at Rs. 90 crores and an EBITDA margin of around 71% for the quarter. The balance sheet remains debt-free with roughly Rs.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company guides for a production exit rate of around 2,500 barrels of oil equivalent per day for the current fiscal year.","quote":"We are hoping that this year we will exit at around 2,500 that is the guidance we are reasonably sure that we should be able to deliver on our promise to you of ramping up to 2,500 barrels of oil gas equivalent production from our portfolio.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Management targets reaching a production level of around 5,000 barrels by FY29.","quote":"So, therefore, we remain confident and on track for 2,500 barrels of oil equivalent exit this year and we are building towards 5,000 barrels business hopefully by FY29, with fiscal discipline remaining our key focus area as well.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company expects to spend around Rs. 250 crores in capital expenditure this year.","quote":"Then we went to Rs.160 crores. Again, we went to Rs.87 crores, then Rs.220 crores, hopefully Rs.250 crores this year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Karjisan drilling is ahead of schedule with 2 of the 7 wells drilled.","quote":"Ahead of schedule: 2 of the 7 wells drilled, well before the planned Q4 first spud","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"OPEX and handling costs decreased to Rs. 6.1 crores from Rs. 7.5 crores in Q1.","quote":"Our OPEX and handling costs came down to Rs.6.1 crores from Rs.7.5 crores in Q1.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Royalty and Cess remained stable at around 16% of revenue, totaling around Rs. 20.5 crores.","quote":"Royalty and Cess remained stable at around 16% of the revenue which totals around Rs.20.5 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Depreciation rose to Rs. 13.2 crores as new Bakrol wells came into production.","quote":"Depreciation rose to Rs.13.2 crores as the new Bakrol Wells came into production.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Average production for October across the portfolio reached around 2,000 barrel oil equivalent.","quote":"Actually, the October production itself, we are at around 2,000 barrel oil equivalent and this is what this month's production across the portfolio has been.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Q2 sales volumes were recorded at 1,656 boepd.","quote":"Q2 Sales Volumes: 1656 boepd","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"},{"claim":"October production reached 1,950 boepd.","quote":"October Production: 1950 boepd","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Gas evacuation and monetization in Assam face structural challenges because Assam is not yet connected to the National Grid.","quote":"The challenge in a gas evacuation and monetization in Assam as of today, not for us, but for a lot of other people as well, is that Assam is not connected yet to the National Grid.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf"},{"claim":"Custody transfer to IOCL ran for only 86 to 87 days resulting in a build-up of approximately 6500 bopd of crude inventory during the quarter.","quote":"Custody transfer to IOCL ran for only ~86–87 days this quarter, and resulted in a build-up of c. 6,500 bopd of crude inventory during the Quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4524e1b9-2839-437c-9549-7b9cdd87e030.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management promises to make investor calls a regular occurrence at the end of quarterly board meetings.","quote":"We have finally managed to have an investor call, and we promise to keep it a regular occurrence at the end of quarterly board meetings, pretty much most hopefully the same day.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f2fadb5e-a161-4a51-9f53-9f4a1fcd027e.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"All 7 wells in Karjisan are to be drilling by April 2027.","quote":"All 7 wells to be drilling by April 2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=116d8371-2623-4ae0-92d0-aaf95181770b.pdf","timeframe":"April 2027"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":14,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":24,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}